<x-filament-panels::page><div class="sr-guide"><div class="sr-guide-hero"><span>STOCKROOM / PRODUCT TOUR</span><h2>Operations you can follow.<br>Rules you can trust.</h2><p>A working Laravel and Filament portfolio project by Abdulrhman Yaghi. All customers, products and orders in this demo are fictional.</p><a href="{{ url('/admin') }}">Open the overview</a></div><div class="sr-guide-grid">@foreach([['01','Read the overview','See confirmed sales, total orders and low stock. The chart excludes cancelled orders.'],['02','Inspect inventory','Open Products. Search by name, filter Low stock only, and use Adjust stock as an administrator. Every adjustment needs a reason.'],['03','Place an order','Open Orders and choose Place order. Select a customer and products, then enter quantities. Prices and available stock are checked on the server.'],['04','Try a cancellation','Cancel a confirmed order. Its stock returns once, even if the cancellation is repeated. Staff may cancel their own orders only.'],['05','Generate a report','As administrator, open Reports, choose a date range and submit. The queue worker creates a private CSV. Wait for Ready, then download.'],['06','Follow the history','Open Activity history as administrator to inspect order, stock and report events. Staff can use the operations screens but cannot access reports or history.']] as [$number,$title,$body])<article><span>{{ $number }}</span><h3>{{ $title }}</h3><p>{{ $body }}</p></article>@endforeach</div><div class="sr-guide-note"><h3>Try the edge cases</h3><p>Order more units than are available. The order should fail without changing any stock. Switch to the staff account and confirm administrator controls are unavailable. Reports include confirmed orders at generation time, use UTC date boundaries and show gross order value, not collected payments.</p></div></div></x-filament-panels::page>
